Package: natality
Title: Access and Inspect United States Natality Data
Version: 0.4.0.9003
Authors@R: person("Atalay", "Demiray", email = "atalay.demiray@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides source-preserving access tools and annual metadata for
    United States natality public-use data. The development version supports
    variable discovery, annual codebook and change-history inspection, cache
    management, verified local-cache imports, and selected-column single-year
    and multi-year reads with annual provenance and comparability warnings.
    Remote record-level releases are exposed only after their source,
    conversion, validation, and checksums are recorded in the package manifest.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/atalaydemiray/natality-atlas
BugReports: https://github.com/atalaydemiray/natality-atlas/issues
